[50.449593, "o", "\r\u001b[2KI’ll first inspect the dataset, environment, and available packages so I can choose an appropriate LoRA training setup.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app && ls -la && echo '--- data ---' && ls -la data && echo '--- python ---' && python -V && echo '--- packages ---' && python - <<'PY'\r\nimport importlib\r\nfor m in ['torch','transformers','peft','datasets','accelerate','numpy']:\r\n    try:\r\n        mod=importlib.import_module(m)\r\n        print(m, getattr(mod,'__version__','?'))\r\n    except Exception as e:\r\n        print(m, 'ERROR', e)\r\nimport torch\r\nprint('cuda available:', torch.cuda.is_available())\r\nif torch.cuda.is_available():\r\n    print(torch.cuda.get_device_name(0))\r\nPY\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠙\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
