[54.114566, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe environment is missing the ML dependencies, so I’ll check for an alternate Python environment and inspect the dataset metadata before installing anything.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app && cat data/metadata.json && echo && python - <<'PY'\r\nimport json\r\nfor split in ['train','val']:\r\n    x=json.load(open(f'data/{split}.json'))\r\n    print(split, type(x), len(x))\r\n    print(json.dumps(x[0], indent=2)[:1000])\r\n    print('answers:', {a:sum(1 for s in x if s['answer']==a) for a in 'ABCD'})\r\nPY\r\necho '--- interpreters ---'\r\nwhich -a python python3 pip pip3 || true\r\nls -la /opt 2>/dev/null || true\r\nls -d /usr/local/lib/python* 2>/dev/null || true\r\nfind / -maxdepth 3 -name 'torch' -type d 2>/dev/null | head\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠼\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[54.114767, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠼\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
