[57.779084, "o", "\r\u001b[2KI found a Python 3.11 installation alongside Python 3.13. I’ll check whether the ML stack already exists there and inspect hardware/network availability.\r\n\r\n```\r\necho '--- py3.11 ---'; /usr/bin/python3 -V; /usr/bin/python3 - <<'PY'\r\nimport importlib, torch\r\nprint('torch', torch.__version__, 'cuda', torch.cuda.is_available(), torch.cuda.get_device_name(0) if torch.cuda.is_available() else '')\r\nfor m in ['transformers','peft','datasets','accelerate']:\r\n try:\r\n  mod=importlib.import_module(m); print(m,getattr(mod,'__version__','?'))\r\n except Exception as e: print(m,e)\r\nPY\r\necho '--- nvidia ---'; nvidia-smi 2>&1 | head -20 || true\r\necho '--- cpu/mem ---'; nproc; free -h\r\necho '--- net ---'; timeout 15 pip index versions peft 2>&1 | head -20 || true\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠼\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
