[262.440148, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[262.440472, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\n`loss_type=None` was set in the config but it is unrecognized. Using the default loss: `ForCausalLMLoss`.\r\ntok loaded 1.6307730674743652\r\nmodel loaded 10.684005975723267 124.439808\r\ntorch.Size([1, 32]) ['Ġfood', 'Ċ', 'Answer', ':', 'ĠA']\r\nfwd+bwd sec 2.0103282928466797\r\n\r\n"]
