[305.749775, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe benchmark timed out before printing because model loading and multiple runs exceeded 30 seconds. I’ll run a shorter token-length check and then implement \r\nthe full training script to run in the background.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app && python - <<'PY'\r\nfrom transformers import AutoTokenizer\r\nimport json, numpy as np\r\ntok=AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained('openai-community/gpt2')\r\nsamples=json.load(open('data/train.json'))\r\ndef full(s):\r\n    return 'Question: '+s['question']+'\\n'+'\\n'.join(s['options'])+'\\nAnswer: '+s['answer']+tok.eos_token\r\nlens=[len(tok(full(s)).input_ids) for s in samples]\r\nprint('token lens', min(lens), round(np.mean(lens),1), int(np.percentile(lens,95)), max(lens))\r\nprint(np.percentile(lens,[50,90,95,99]))\r\nPY\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠹\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
