[443.164647, "o", "\r\u001b[2K`ps` isn’t installed in this minimal image. I’ll use `/proc` to inspect whether training is still running and how much CPU it is using.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app && if [ -d /proc/$(cat train_lora.pid) ]; then echo RUNNING; cat /proc/$(cat train_lora.pid)/status | head -20; echo '--- stat ---'; awk '{print \r\n\"utime_ticks=\"$14\" stime_ticks=\"$15\" threads=\"$20}' /proc/$(cat train_lora.pid)/stat; else echo NOT_RUNNING; fi; echo '--- log ---'; tail -20 train_lora.log\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠼\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
