[483.158526, "o", "\r\u001b[2KTraining is running but slow, likely due to CPU thread oversubscription from the many-threaded PyTorch build. I’ll wait briefly for the first log line; if it \r\nremains inefficient I’ll restart with fewer threads and a more compact training setup.\r\n\r\n```\r\nsleep 25; cd /app && if [ -d /proc/$(cat train_lora.pid) ]; then echo RUNNING; awk '{print \"cpu_ticks=\"$14+$15\" threads=\"$20}' /proc/$(cat train_lora.pid)/stat;\r\nelse echo DONE_OR_EXITED; fi; tail -30 train_lora.log\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
